---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import 'katex/dist/katex.min.css';
import '../styles/document.css';
---
<qft-markdown-workspace data-view="split" class="workspace" id="main-content">
  <aside class="document-sidebar" aria-label="Documents" data-sidebar>
    <div class="sidebar-heading"><span>Your workspace</span><button class="icon-button mobile-sidebar-close" data-close-sidebar aria-label="Close document sidebar"><Icon name="close" /></button></div>
    <button class="new-document" data-new><Icon name="plus" size={17} /> New document <kbd>N</kbd></button>
    <button class="open-file" data-open><Icon name="upload" size={16} /> Open Markdown file</button>
    <div class="sidebar-section-title">MY DOCUMENTS <span data-doc-count>0</span></div>
    <div class="document-list" data-documents role="list" aria-label="Saved documents"><p class="loading-documents">Opening your workspace…</p></div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <button class="sidebar-link" data-show-examples><span class="sidebar-link-icon"><Icon name="spark" size={17} /></span><span>Start with an example<small>A little inspiration</small></span><Icon name="chevron" size={14} /></button>
    <a class="sidebar-link" href="/guide/"><span class="sidebar-link-icon"><Icon name="book" size={17} /></span><span>Markdown & math guide<small>Make yourself at home</small></span><Icon name="chevron" size={14} /></a>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom"><Icon name="shield" size={17} /><p>A space of your own.<span>Your documents stay in this browser.</span></p></div>
  </aside>
  <button class="sidebar-scrim" data-sidebar-scrim aria-label="Close document sidebar" hidden></button>
  <main class="workspace-main">
    <div class="document-toolbar">
      <button class="icon-button" data-toggle-sidebar aria-label="Toggle document sidebar" title="Documents"><Icon name="sidebar" /></button>
      <span class="toolbar-rule"></span>
      <div class="document-title-area"><button class="document-title" data-rename title="Rename document"><span data-document-title>Opening document</span><Icon name="edit" size={13} /></button><span class="save-state" data-save-state><span class="save-dot"></span><span data-save-label>Getting ready</span></span></div>
      <div class="document-toolbar-actions">
        <button class="icon-button" data-duplicate aria-label="Duplicate document" title="Duplicate document"><Icon name="copy" size={17} /></button>
        <button class="icon-button" data-settings aria-label="Editor settings" title="Editor settings"><Icon name="sliders" size={17} /></button>
        <span class="toolbar-rule"></span>
        <div class="export-wrapper">
          <button class="export-button" data-export-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="export-menu"><Icon name="download" size={16} /><span>Export</span><Icon name="down" size={14} /></button>
          <div class="dropdown-menu export-menu" id="export-menu" data-export-menu hidden>
            <button data-export-md><Icon name="file" /><span>Markdown<small>Keep an editable copy</small></span><kbd>.md</kbd></button>
            <button data-export-html><Icon name="code" /><span>Standalone HTML<small>Math fonts included · opens offline</small></span><kbd>.html</kbd></button>
            <button data-print><Icon name="print" /><span>Print / Save PDF<small>A clean, typeset document</small></span><kbd>⌘P</kbd></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="workspace-intro"><p><span class="intro-line"></span> Your ideas, beautifully expressed.</p><div class="view-switch" role="group" aria-label="Workspace layout"><button data-view-mode="editor" aria-pressed="false" title="Editor only"><Icon name="code" size={15} /><span>Editor</span></button><button data-view-mode="split" aria-pressed="true" title="Split view"><Icon name="split" size={15} /><span>Split</span></button><button data-view-mode="preview" aria-pressed="false" title="Preview only"><Icon name="eye" size={15} /><span>Preview</span></button></div></div>
    <div class="editor-workspace" data-panels>
      <section class="source-panel" aria-label="Markdown source">
        <div class="panel-heading"><span class="panel-title"><span class="panel-dot"></span> MARKDOWN</span><div class="panel-tools"><span class="syntax-label">Plain text. Endless possibilities.</span><button class="icon-button small" data-find aria-label="Find and replace" title="Find and replace (Ctrl/⌘ F)"><Icon name="search" size={16} /></button></div></div>
        <div class="code-editor" data-editor><div class="editor-loading">Preparing your editor…</div></div>
        <div class="panel-bottom"><span data-cursor>Ln 1, Col 1</span><span class="language-label">Markdown <span>UTF-8</span></span></div>
      </section>
      <div class="panel-resizer" data-resizer role="separator" aria-label="Resize editor and preview" aria-orientation="vertical" aria-valuenow="50" aria-valuemin="25" aria-valuemax="75" tabindex="0"><span></span></div>
      <section class="preview-panel" aria-label="Document preview">
        <div class="panel-heading"><span class="panel-title"><span class="panel-dot preview-dot"></span> PREVIEW</span><div class="panel-tools"><span class="live-label" data-render-state><span></span> Live</span><button class="icon-button small" data-outline-toggle aria-label="Toggle document outline" aria-expanded="false" title="Document outline"><Icon name="list" size={17} /></button></div></div>
        <div class="preview-body">
          <div class="outline-panel" data-outline-panel hidden><div class="outline-heading">IN THIS DOCUMENT<button class="icon-button small" data-outline-close aria-label="Close outline"><Icon name="close" size={14} /></button></div><nav data-outline aria-label="Document outline"></nav></div>
          <div class="preview-scroll" data-preview-scroll tabindex="0" aria-label="Rendered document"><article class="markdown-document" data-preview><p class="preview-placeholder">Good ideas begin with a few words.</p></article></div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-bottom"><span data-reading-time>Ready when you are</span><span class="typeset-label">Typeset with <strong>KaTeX</strong></span></div>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="diagnostics" data-diagnostics hidden><button class="diagnostics-heading" data-diagnostics-toggle aria-expanded="true"><span data-error-heading>Check your mathematics</span><Icon name="down" size={14} /></button><div data-error-list></div></div>
    <footer class="workspace-footer"><div class="document-stats"><span data-word-count>0 words</span><span class="stat-divider">·</span><span data-char-count>0 characters</span><span class="stat-divider">·</span><span data-math-count>0 equations</span></div><label class="sync-control"><input type="checkbox" data-sync checked /><span class="switch-track"></span><Icon name="link" size={13} /> Sync scrolling</label><span class="footer-note">A little space to think.</span></footer>
  </main>
  <input type="file" data-file-input accept=".md,.markdown,.txt,text/markdown,text/plain" hidden />
  <div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-toast hidden></div>
  <dialog class="app-dialog" data-name-dialog aria-labelledby="name-dialog-title"><form method="dialog" data-name-form><div class="dialog-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR DOCUMENT</span><button type="button" class="icon-button" data-name-close aria-label="Close"><Icon name="close" /></button></div><h2 id="name-dialog-title">Give your ideas a name.</h2><p>A descriptive title makes your notes easier to find.</p><label for="document-name">Document title</label><input id="document-name" name="title" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" data-name-input /><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="button-secondary" data-name-close>Cancel</button><button class="button-primary" value="save">Save title <Icon name="check" size={16} /></button></div></form></dialog>
  <dialog class="app-dialog" data-delete-dialog aria-labelledby="delete-dialog-title"><form method="dialog" data-delete-form><div class="dialog-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MAKE SOME ROOM</span><button type="button" class="icon-button" data-delete-close aria-label="Close"><Icon name="close" /></button></div><h2 id="delete-dialog-title">Delete this document?</h2><p><strong data-delete-title></strong> will be removed from this browser. Download a copy first if you want to keep it.</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="button-secondary" data-delete-close>Keep document</button><button class="button-primary" value="delete">Delete document</button></div></form></dialog>
  <dialog class="app-dialog examples-dialog" data-examples-dialog aria-labelledby="examples-dialog-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A PLACE TO BEGIN</span><button class="icon-button" data-examples-close aria-label="Close examples"><Icon name="close" /></button></div><h2 id="examples-dialog-title">Start with a little inspiration.</h2><p>Open an example as a new document and make it your own.</p><div data-examples-list class="example-options"></div></dialog>
  <dialog class="app-dialog settings-dialog" data-settings-dialog aria-labelledby="settings-dialog-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</span><button class="icon-button" data-settings-close aria-label="Close settings"><Icon name="close" /></button></div><h2 id="settings-dialog-title">A comfortable place to write.</h2><div class="setting-row"><div><label for="editor-font-size">Editor text size</label><p>Give your source a little breathing room.</p></div><select id="editor-font-size" data-font-size><option value="12">12 px</option><option value="13">13 px</option><option value="14" selected>14 px</option><option value="15">15 px</option><option value="16">16 px</option><option value="18">18 px</option></select></div><div class="setting-row"><div><label for="wrap-lines">Wrap long lines</label><p>Keep the whole sentence in view.</p></div><input id="wrap-lines" type="checkbox" checked data-wrap /></div><div class="setting-row"><div><label for="remote-images">Load remote images</label><p>Off by default. Enabling contacts the image hosts in this document.</p></div><input id="remote-images" type="checkbox" data-remote-images /></div><div class="settings-note"><Icon name="shield" size={18} /><p>Drafts are saved only in this browser. Export a copy to keep a backup.</p></div><div class="shortcut-list"><span>Download Markdown <kbd>Ctrl / ⌘ S</kbd></span><span>Open a file <kbd>Ctrl / ⌘ O</kbd></span><span>Find in source <kbd>Ctrl / ⌘ F</kbd></span></div></dialog>
  <noscript><div class="noscript-notice">Enable JavaScript to use the editor. You can still read the <a href="/guide/">Markdown & math guide</a>.</div></noscript>
</qft-markdown-workspace>
<script>
  import '../scripts/markdown-workspace';
</script>
